{"seq":1,"slug":"ops-kpi-sla-metrics-dashboard","title":"运营 KPI 指标体系与 SLA 看板：异常率、处置时长与积压","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-management-ops-workbench-exception-queue/observability-metrics-automation/ops-kpi-sla-metrics-dashboard","wordCount":2961,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"运营-kpi-指标体系与-sla-看板-异常率-处置时长与积压\">运营 KPI 指标体系与 SLA 看板：异常率、处置时长与积压</h1><p>一个异常工作台最昂贵的失败模式不是「没有看板」，而是看板上每块数字都好看、队列却在悄悄腐烂。根因几乎总是同一处：把三个不同量纲的指标塞进同一视图——<strong>异常率</strong>（占订单比例）、<strong>处置时长</strong>（单笔分位数）、<strong>积压</strong>（瞬时工作量）。它们数学上不可通约，放同一张折线图里就会互相遮蔽：处置时长因快单被优先处理而下降，同时老单在尾部越积越厚。承接上一篇《<a href=\"../exception-queue-workflow/exception-routing-priority-sla\">异常队列路由、优先级与 SLA：分派、升级与超时催办</a>》定下的「队列 × 优先级 → 目标时钟」，本文解决这些时钟的达成情况怎么度量、展示、触发动作，框架直接搬 Google SRE 的成熟抽象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-指标分层-从原始事件到可行动信号\">核心概念：指标分层，从原始事件到可行动信号</h2><p>Google SRE 书给出的「四大黄金信号」是 <strong>latency、traffic、errors、saturation</strong>——只能测四个面向用户的指标时，就测这四个（Google, <em>Site Reliability Engineering</em>, Monitoring Distributed Systems）。映射到异常处置工作台：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>黄金信号</th>\n<th>工作台对应量</th>\n<th>口径要点</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Latency</td>\n<td>处置时长（首响/结单）</td>\n<td>分位数，成功/失败分开统计</td>\n<td>只报均值，尾部被吞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traffic</td>\n<td>异常入队速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>按队列/类型/渠道切分</td>\n<td>全站一个总数，掩盖局部尖峰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Errors</td>\n<td>处置质量（误处置、返工、赔付）</td>\n<td>显式失败 + 隐性错误</td>\n<td>只看「是否关闭」，不看「关得对不对」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Saturation</td>\n<td>积压 WIP 与人均负载 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>队列深度 + 利用率</td>\n<td>只看绝对值，不看相对产能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>术语必须先分清，否则「SLA 达成率」会各队列各算各的。<strong>SLA</strong> 是服务方与客户之间的约束性协议，<strong>SLO</strong> 是其下针对某一性能面的目标，<strong>SLI</strong> 是衡量目标是否达成的指标（Wikipedia, <em>Service-level agreement</em>）。工作台的「服务」就是异常被处置：SLI = 结单时长 P95，SLO = 「P95 ≤ 8 小时」，SLA = 对渠道商的赔偿条款。缺了 SLI 的口径，SLA 只是一句无法结算的口号。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E[原始处置事件&lt;br/&gt;认领/更新/结单/重开] --&gt; M[指标聚合层&lt;br/&gt;分位数+计数直方图]&#10;  M --&gt; K1[异常率 SLI]&#10;  M --&gt; K2[处置时长 SLI&lt;br/&gt;P50/P95/P99]&#10;  M --&gt; K3[积压 SLI&lt;br/&gt;WIP+最老单龄]&#10;  K1 --&gt; S[SLO 达成判定&lt;br/&gt;滚动窗口]&#10;  K2 --&gt; S&#10;  K3 --&gt; S&#10;  S --&gt; B[误差预算剩余]&#10;  B --&gt; A{燃烧率超阈?}&#10;  A --&gt;|是 快烧| P[分页告警&lt;br/&gt;立即介入]&#10;  A --&gt;|是 慢烧| T[工单告警&lt;br/&gt;排期处理]&#10;  A --&gt;|否| N[静默 只做趋势]\">graph TD\n  E[原始处置事件&lt;br/&gt;认领/更新/结单/重开] --&gt; M[指标聚合层&lt;br/&gt;分位数+计数直方图]\n  M --&gt; K1[异常率 SLI]\n  M --&gt; K2[处置时长 SLI&lt;br/&gt;P50/P95/P99]\n  M --&gt; K3[积压 SLI&lt;br/&gt;WIP+最老单龄]\n  K1 --&gt; S[SLO 达成判定&lt;br/&gt;滚动窗口]\n  K2 --&gt; S\n  K3 --&gt; S\n  S --&gt; B[误差预算剩余]\n  B --&gt; A{燃烧率超阈?}\n  A --&gt;|是 快烧| P[分页告警&lt;br/&gt;立即介入]\n  A --&gt;|是 慢烧| T[工单告警&lt;br/&gt;排期处理]\n  A --&gt;|否| N[静默 只做趋势]</pre><p>分层的意义在于每层只回答一个问题：SLI 答「现在是多少」，SLO 答「和承诺差多少」，误差预算答「还能承受多少劣化」，燃烧率答「要不要现在叫人」。压成一块「大盘」，就退化成一墙没人行动的装饰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常率与处置质量-分母口径决定一切\">异常率与处置质量：分母口径决定一切</h2><p>异常率是唯一一个「分子对了、分母错了」也会长期稳定的指标，口径必须一次定死并写进看板图例。跨境场景至少有三种分母：<strong>全部订单量</strong>、<strong>已付款订单量</strong>、<strong>已发货订单量</strong>。用已发货做分母会低估履约前异常，用全部订单做分母又会把未支付取消混进来。行业惯例是分开算再合并看：Amazon 账户健康把<strong>订单缺陷率（ODR）</strong>、<strong>发货前取消率</strong>、<strong>迟发率</strong>并列考核，而非合成一个数（Amazon Seller Central, <em>Account Health</em>）。</p>\n<p><strong>error 侧同样要拆显式与隐性。</strong> SRE 定义里 errors 不只含显式失败，还包括「返回成功但内容错误」与「策略违规——例如响应慢于承诺阈值」（Google, <em>SRE</em>）。映射到工作台：一笔异常被标记「已关闭」但三周内因同一订单重开，是典型隐性错误；它不进异常率，但进 <strong>返工率</strong>，必须单独度量并纳入考核，否则运营会学会「先关掉再重开」。</p>\n<p><strong>防刷指标的机制是配对指标。</strong> 只有单向激励的 KPI 都会被博弈：只考结单时长的队伍会快速关闭疑难单，只考异常率的队伍会拒绝录入异常。落地做法是每个效率指标配一个质量护栏、同屏展示：结单时长 ↔ 30 天内重开率；人均结单量 ↔ 赔付金额中位数；首次响应及时率 ↔ 差评/升级率。护栏不必设目标，但必须与主指标并列，让「用质量换速度」一眼可见。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处置时长-分位数-计时点与暂停还原\">处置时长：分位数、计时点与暂停还原</h2><p><strong>均值在处置时长语境下基本无用。</strong> SRE 书给的例子很直观：平均延迟 100 ms、每秒 1000 请求时，「1% 的请求可能耗时 5 秒」——均值把尾部全藏了起来，而异常处置正是长尾业务，少数疑难单决定客户体验。正确做法是用<strong>计数直方图</strong>加分位数（P50/P95/P99），桶边界按指数间隔划分，才能同时看清中位数与尾部（Google, <em>SRE</em>, Monitoring Distributed Systems）。</p>\n<p>计时点必须先定义再比较，跨境团队最常踩的坑是「时钟从哪算」。工作台至少要区分四类时钟点，它们的组合构成完整时长画像：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>计时点</th>\n<th>起点</th>\n<th>终点</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首次响应</td>\n<td>入队时刻</td>\n<td>首次人工认领</td>\n<td>有没有人管</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期更新</td>\n<td>上次更新</td>\n<td>本次更新</td>\n<td>有没有卡死失联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解决时长</td>\n<td>认领时刻</td>\n<td>结单时刻</td>\n<td>处置本身快不快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复时长</td>\n<td>入队时刻</td>\n<td>结单时刻</td>\n<td>客户多久拿到结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个四分法与客服体系一致——SLA 策略通常按工单优先级对首次响应、下一次响应、周期更新、解决时间分别设时长目标。<strong>「解决时长」与「恢复时长」的差别不是学术细节</strong>：MTTR 的度量揭示，从「发现」到「恢复」与从「开始修复」到「恢复」可能相差数倍，零件等待、审批、跨时区交接都可能让名义「24 小时修复」实际变成七天恢复（Wikipedia, <em>Mean time to repair</em>）。看板必须标注用的是哪一个，否则达标率在队列之间不可比。</p>\n<p><strong>暂停时间要能还原。</strong> 有效计时</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{eff} = T_{elapsed} - \\sum_i T_{pause,i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>中暂停只允许白名单原因（等客户补料、等上游物流商/发卡行），起止时间戳与原因码必须落库。看板同时展示两个分位数——若差距持续拉大，说明时间消耗在「等外部」，这是流程与供应商问题，与运营产能问题的干预手段完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"积压与吞吐-little-s-law-与利用率非线性\">积压与吞吐：Little&#39;s Law 与利用率非线性</h2><p>积压不能只看绝对值。「队列里 800 单」在产能 2000 单/天与 200 单/天的两个队列里含义天差地别。最有用的两个量是<strong>最老单龄</strong>（对应客户流失风险）与<strong>人均负载</strong>（对应团队是否被压垮）。</p>\n<p>Little&#39;s Law 给出积压、吞吐与停留时长之间的恒等关系：稳定系统中，系统内的平均工作量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>（WIP）、平均到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、平均停留时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>（cycle time）满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它不依赖到达与服务分布，也不依赖调度顺序，只要系统平稳遍历即成立（Wikipedia, <em>Little&#39;s law</em>）。含义很直接：<strong>到达率不变时，想把停留时长减半就必须把 WIP 减半</strong>——增人不改变等待时长，只提高吞吐。这也是看板的自洽性校验：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 三者算不平，说明口径或窗口出了问题。</p>\n<p>积压对时长的非线性放大则来自排队论。G/G/1 队列的平均等待时间由 Kingman 公式近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><munder><munder><mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mi>U</mi></munder><mo>⋅</mo><munder><munder><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mi>V</mi></munder><mo>⋅</mo><munder><munder><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mi>T</mi></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}(W_q) \\approx \\underbrace{\\frac{\\rho}{1-\\rho}}_{U} \\cdot \\underbrace{\\frac{c_a^2 + c_s^2}{2}}_{V} \\cdot \\underbrace{\\tau}_{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3143em;vertical-align:-2.2068em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-0.9008em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1076em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1076em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1076em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-1.5791em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1076em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 